{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54240","headline":"六合怀古诗 晋王城 · 郏滂","name":"六合怀古诗 晋王城","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"隋收建业临江渚，东望金陵筑此城。\n正与石头爲对岸，从兹一统六朝平。\n（〖1〗《嘉靖志》注：「《嘉定志》。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郏滂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54240.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54240","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}